UID:10003014-1787936400-1787949000@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Duet Allegro and Cousins Maine Lobster
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck Night at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis Friday\, August 28 | 5–8:30 PM\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nKick off your weekend with an unforgettable evening of live music\, fresh lobster rolls\, and award-winning wine at Great Bear Vineyards!\nRelax among the vines with a glass of your favorite estate-grown wine while enjoying the beautiful sounds of Duet Allegro. Cousins Maine Lobster will be serving their famous lobster rolls\, chowders\, and seafood favorites from 5–8:30 PM\, with live music from 6–7:30 PM.\n Music by Duet Allegro\nWe’re delighted to welcome Duet Allegro back to the winery! This talented brother-and-sister duo combines the elegance of classical violin with the warmth of Spanish guitar\, creating a beautiful and relaxing performance that’s the perfect soundtrack for a summer evening in the vineyard.\n Food by Cousins Maine Lobster\nCome hungry! Cousins Maine Lobster will be serving their popular lobster rolls\, seafood sandwiches\, creamy chowders\, and other East Coast favorites. It’s the perfect pairing with a glass of Great Bear wine. Please help us support this fantastic local food truck by purchasing your dinner onsite and leaving outside food at home.\n Your Evening Includes A glass of Great Bear estate-grown wine Live music by Duet Allegro (6–7:30 PM) Fresh lobster rolls and seafood favorites available for purchase (5–8:30 PM) Beautiful vineyard views and a relaxing summer atmosphere\nGather your friends\, raise a glass\, and enjoy an evening of great wine\, delicious food\, and beautiful live music. We can’t wait to welcome you to the vineyard!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/duet-allegro-and-cousins-maine-lobster/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Highway128PressTrip_GreatBearVineyards_2024_MaxWhittaker_12-Copy-scaled-OoIRnT.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
